title: Credit Crisis
subtitle: Credit dries up; firms cut work.
new-page: true
tags: pl_event
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.creditEventDue(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Event economy.credit_crisis (technical reference 17.13 B16, 17.16.2; card catalogue 9.12): shown only
// with executive access of PPS. The first answer is free; the intervention has its ordinary costs.
for (var option of ['credit', 'orders', 'protection']) {
    Q['pl_ev_' + option + '_why'] = PolishProjects.eventStatus(Q, 'credit', option).reason;
}
!}

= A credit crisis

Credit has fallen below 35 for two months, or the scenario's credit shock of 1925 has begun. Credit and output fall; firms cut work. PPS can use the portfolios it holds.

- @credit
- @orders
- @protection
- @none

@credit
title: A conditional credit for threatened activity
subtitle: Prepares the credit instrument of Treasury or Industry; its launch waits in the card “Prepared Reforms”.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.eventStatus(Q, 'credit', 'credit').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_ev_credit_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.eventChoose(Q, 'credit', 'credit');
!}
go-to: result

@orders
title: Keep up employment through orders or prepared works
subtitle: One package of public orders, or the launch of prepared public works.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.eventStatus(Q, 'credit', 'orders').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_ev_orders_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.eventChoose(Q, 'credit', 'orders');
!}
go-to: result

@protection
title: Concentrate the means on protection for those losing work
subtitle: The protection for the unemployed; no automatic fall of unemployment.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.eventStatus(Q, 'credit', 'protection').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_ev_protection_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.eventChoose(Q, 'credit', 'protection');
!}
go-to: result

@none
title: No new intervention
subtitle: No expense and no bonus.
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.eventChoose(Q, 'credit', 'none');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= A credit crisis

[+ pl_gc_result +]

- @root: Continue.
